                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> w3dpv:Rule;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A rule that is acceptable where it is either desirable if it occurs or it is not unacceptable if it does"@en;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:rules-classes;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Acceptable Rule"@en;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """Acceptable is a subjective concept that enables distinguishing with \"unacceptable\". By itself it does not signal any permission or obligation - for which further specific concepts are defined"""@en.
