                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> w3dpv:Right;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The right(s) applicable, provided, or expected that need to be (actively) exercised"@en;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:rights-classes;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Active Right"@en;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Active rights require the entity to expressly exercise them. For example, a Data Subject exercising their right to withdraw their consent."@en.
