                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Status indicating the specified context is 'actively' involved"@en;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:status-classes;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Actively Involved"@en;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "An example of active involvement is a person directly using a system to enter information"@en.
