                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> w3dpv:ActivityStatus;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "State of an activity that could not be completed, but has reached some end state"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:status-classes;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Activity Not Completed"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This relates to a 'Stop' state as distinct from a 'Halt' state. It makes no comments on whether the Activity can be resumed or continued towards completion."@en.
