                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> w3dpv:OrganisationGovernance;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Measures associated with topics typically considered to be part of 'Data Governance'"@en;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:organisational-measures-classes;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data Governance"@en.
