                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data Security Management"@en;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Examples of data security management are assessing the appropriate security controls such as encryption, testing the implemented security controls, and ensuring it is protected and safeguarded from unintended actions"@en.
