                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data Source"@en;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Source' is the direct point of data collection; 'origin' would indicate the original/others points of where the data originates from."@en.
