                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Policy regarding storage of data, including the manner, duration, location, and conditions for storage"@en;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:organisational-measures-classes;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data Storage Policy"@en.
w3dpv:DataSubProcessor <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:Bb4025b4c989c25034fd54e030bd87587;
