                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Purposes associated with performing authentication based on identity as a form of security"@en;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:purposes-classes;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Identity Authentication"@en.
