                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Indicates that technology is being used in an innovative manner"@en;
                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:processing-context-classes;
                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Innovative use of Technology"@en;
                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Innovative here refers to 'state of the art' rather than the implementing entity, and can be for either new technology or new uses of existing technology"@en.
