                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Large Scale Processing"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """The exact definition of what constitutes \"large scale\" depends on use of jurisdictional, domain-specific, or other forms of externally defined criteria. Where possible, this should be reflected by extending this term with the appropriate context."""@en.
