                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Indicates how the data subject can manage their consent in terms of providing it, or reaffirming or withdrawing a given consent. This concept is useful to represent a single location or interface where multiple controls are provided for consent"@en.
