                           <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> w3dpv:RightsManagement;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Methods to obtain, provide, modify, and withdraw permissions along with maintaining a record of permissions, retrieving records, and processing changes in permission states"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:organisational-measures-classes;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Permission Management"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Permission is a broader concept than '(Informed) Consent' as consent when used as a legal basis has specific requirements to be valid. For management of consent, see the concept dpv:ConsentManagement"@en.
w3dpv:PermissionNotUtilised <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:Bb4025b4c989c25034fd54e030bd87587;
                            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-09-10"^^xsd:date;
