                      <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> w3dpv:LegalEntity;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An organisation that is characterised as a Small or Medium-sized Enterprise based on limited staff and revenue"@en;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:entities-organisation-classes;
                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "SME Organisation"@en.
w3dpv:Safeguard <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:B39a5f196e4ce742b655078f42dbb4759,
