                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Purposes associated with selling or sharing insights obtained from analysis of data"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> w3dpv:purposes-classes;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sell Insights from Data"@en;
                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Sell here means exchange, submit, or provide in return for direct or indirect compensation. Was subclass of commercial interest, changed to reflect selling something"@en.
